{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RVZzk5HZ9D1792824693.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>約旦多名槍手向一間東正教教堂施襲，最少7死、逾34人傷，2人傷勢嚴重，當局已定性為恐襲，正調查兇徒身份及動機。聯合國及埃及等鄰國均譴責這次襲擊。</p><p></p><p>遇襲東正教教堂的閉路電視片段，顯示有三名槍手先在教堂門口向教堂內開火。兩人持手槍，另一人用疑似半自動步槍。三人在門口徘徊不夠一分鐘，再持槍闖入教堂。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOR.CHURCH-1300-1_CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261HodGQU3wM1792824781.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在周五，約旦首都安曼以南約180公里的卡拉克省，當時民眾在教堂內出席喪禮，槍手向民眾開火施襲。當局已將事件定性為恐襲，全力展開調查。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOR.CHURCH-1300-1_CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AFOCify6Fp1792824818.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>首相哈桑指，這宗是極端恐怖主義的產物，絕不允許再發生，強調會採取最嚴厲的法律手段，懲罰煽動極端主義的人。教堂入夜後仍未解封，見到有玻璃窗碎裂。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOR.CHURCH-1300-1_CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NaRBSpX5Rp1792824846.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>現場遺下大灘血漬，被帆布覆蓋。</p><p></p><p>國王阿卜杜拉二世到醫院探望襲擊中的傷者，向他們表達慰問，並祝他們早日康復。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOR.CHURCH-1300-1_CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Xt3RR7vI3U1792824866.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>他強調會嚴懲恐怖行徑。約旦多個鄰國，包括黎巴嫩、敘利亞、埃及等都譴責這次襲擊，聯合國亦提出譴責。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:02.173811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:12.063762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:12.919294+00:00","content_hash":"0931a9a03035364193975980fd56594f3586e0d46e136facde8fd453e6fde48f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}